            "text": "chifa"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " dish built on "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "high-heat-frying"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "high-heat frying"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " in a wok. The beef needs a properly screaming hot pan so it sears rather than stews. The chips are cooked separately and added at the end, which keeps them from going soft in the sauce."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tip: cut the beef against the grain into strips no thicker than 1cm. Thinner strips sear faster and stay more tender."
          }
        ]
      },
